            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 25,
              "start": 25
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Defenders of Wildlife argue that the EPA must consult with the Fish and Wildlife Service and NOAA under the Endangered Species Act, and that a memorandum of agreement is relevant to the approval process."
      }
