              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to National Association of Home Builders, section 402(b) requires the EPA to approve a state's application unless the state legal authority criteria are not satisfied."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "National Association of Home Builders",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "ed31cf2bb0959581d21d5d77fa814c8055e8fe048f3b2aa166a23b6590e57c42",
