              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 20,
                "start": 20
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "EPA argues that pre\u2011existing ESA regulations require draft permits to be furnished to the Fish and Wildlife Service and NOAA, and that these considerations affect the approval process."
